      "writtenOn": "2023-12-12T17:47:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `VK_ANDROID_external_memory_android_hardware_buffer` extension (which provides us with important utilities/structs such as `VkAndroidHardwareBufferPropertiesANDROID`) is not yet ratified or promoted to a Vulkan release, so we should check for that extension support.\n\nhttps://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.3-extensions/man/html/VK_ANDROID_external_memory_android_hardware_buffer.html#_ratification_status",
      "range": {
